msgid "Archived: Recording and Playing Back Missions"
msgstr "已归档：任务记录与回放"

#: ../../source/docs/common-recording-and-playing-back-missions.rst:9
#: 00a5bc7f24844149bb3c513049f5be97 53e7471c570a449fbc6e85ebb9f984b5
#: 642b04858f4c4842a2f0c7fbfec96beb b4a65cf758a841f2b285092eccc07a55
#: ee6b53c3e2e14c5db68b39ce9181d580 f21880c7e31a4e0299d50b68c02157a0
msgid ""
"If you are using wireless telemetry and have connected to APM via the "
"Mission Planner, your flight data will automatically recorded as a \"tlog\" "
"file in the Mission Planner's logs folder."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用无线数传并通过 Mission Planner 连接到 APM，飞行数据将自动记录为 Mission Planner "
"日志文件夹中的「tlog」文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-recording-and-playing-back-missions.rst:13
#: 33c10469f07047ec91705ced5337c43a 49d99ded003040578ed106425a7cbeed
#: 554724ee64eb4712be01c604770a3718 659d6bc5e5a04e4d827b70ffb301781d
#: 8d6567653f484865bd8c91436be3337a b2c67681440141e4b3e9c826c1ea277a
msgid ""
"You can load and replay any one and convert any log to a KMZ file that can "
"be displayed in Google Earth by clicking on the KMZ button. That file can "
"also be found in the logs folder."
msgstr ""
"您可以加载并回放任意一条日志，也可以通过点击 KMZ 按钮将任意日志转换为可在 Google Earth 中显示的 KMZ "
"文件。该文件也可在日志文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-recording-and-playing-back-missions.rst:20
#: 05ea70994cb54c2887e531d6703d2d53 1decef243b334c1abfe1b9f8684cdf1d
#: 47a8b79fb51d4028842212e5f7e449f6 7d7a8221e0b24a82975cf11e601e48e0
#: ada90b594c1c452597a19bcf9c1911b0 cc52ba595ff149168c09841a1866023c
msgid ""
"While the log is replaying, you can analyze the data by clicking on the "
"\"Tuning\" checkbox under the map display in the Flight Data tab. It will "
"show the recorded data changing as the flight progresses. You can double "
"click on the data legend to bring up a box that will let you choose which "
"data fields are graphed, as shown here:"
msgstr ""
"日志回放时，可在飞行数据标签页的地图显示下方点击「Tuning」复选框来分析数据，将会显示随飞行进展而变化的记录数据。双击数据图例可弹出对话框，让您选择绘制哪些数据字段，如下所示："

